// maps buffer, regions of map_res^2 bins: per tested set PATH_DEBUG_SET_REGIONS of draw count,
// continuous draw count, sum of 1/pdf (float), of 1/pdf^2 (float), the sum of 1/pdf at the batch
// start, the sum of squared batch residuals and the last batch residual (float); then the guided
// draw count, BSDF pdf() (float; negative = under-resolved), 1 where pdf() is positive in every
// probed direction, BSDF sample()'s count, the frame's sums of 1/pdf and 1/pdf^2 each with its
// rounding errors (float), their totals (float-float), BSDF eval() cos RGB, the integrand RGB of
// every technique's draws, the sum of its squared luminance and the sphere's panel value (float)
static const uint32_t PATH_DEBUG_SET_REGIONS = 7;
